<h2>LLM Wiki — the System and Capture</h2>
<p>This material organizes the <strong>"LLM Wiki / Yohan Gu"</strong> talk paragraph by paragraph, in order. In the age of artificial intelligence, <strong>where and how you organize your own material</strong> matters enormously. We have already been extending context to AI with markdown files such as Claude Code's <code>CLAUDE.md</code> and <code>memory.md</code>, and <strong>Obsidian</strong> is a system that contextualizes all of it into a single framework.</p>

