<h3>What LLM Wiki is</h3>
<p>It is a concept proposed by Karpathy in an April 2026 X post ("LLM Knowledge Bases") and the 'llm-wiki' gist: a system that lets artificial intelligence reference knowledge by embedding live, <strong>without heavy RAG that builds vector or graph databases and without continuous compiling</strong>. Once you build a knowledge base in an Obsidian vault, AI looks at the <strong>map and navigation (signposts)</strong> and finds its way to the knowledge.</p>

